AmneziaWG · Config Lab (static edition)

This project is an independent, browser-only reimplementation inspired by
the configuration format and behaviour of:

  HereIamGosu/amnezia-config-gen
  https://github.com/HereIamGosu/amnezia-config-gen
  Copyright (C) 2026 HereIamGosu
  Licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 only.

The original server-side project requires a backend to register Cloudflare
WARP devices. This GitHub Pages edition has no backend; it asks the user to
supply an already registered WARP private key, or to generate a local key for
a self-hosted AmneziaWG/WireGuard server. It also omits vpn:// link encoding
and live IP preset feeds.

